    "detailed_description": "<strong>Aleph</strong> is the first letter of the Hebrew alphabet, and it is generally <strong>silent</strong>. However, it can be combined with the <strong>niqqud</strong> (vowels) to make a <strong>sound</strong>.<br><br>A word-less game about language.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/4c3176a1dfc988be0af72973f4034224.poster.avif?t=1677664983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/4c3176a1dfc988be0af72973f4034224.webm?t=1677664983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/4c3176a1dfc988be0af72973f4034224.mp4?t=1677664983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Discover and understand apparently arbitrary rules.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/97e1ef628d1b88495e2f6288c12f5544.poster.avif?t=1677664983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/97e1ef628d1b88495e2f6288c12f5544.webm?t=1677664983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/97e1ef628d1b88495e2f6288c12f5544.mp4?t=1677664983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Find new sounds with unique uses.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/44494a70ba96e7e3fb6d5ff850ab8063.poster.avif?t=1677664983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/44494a70ba96e7e3fb6d5ff850ab8063.webm?t=1677664983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/44494a70ba96e7e3fb6d5ff850ab8063.mp4?t=1677664983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Talk.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/b2932c9ad32260e997cb9456be64778c.poster.avif?t=1677664983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/b2932c9ad32260e997cb9456be64778c.webm?t=1677664983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823730/extras/b2932c9ad32260e997cb9456be64778c.mp4?t=1677664983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
